<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>관리자 로그인 - 모아서</title>
    <style>
        *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
        body{font-family:'Malgun Gothic','Apple SD Gothic Neo',-apple-system,sans-serif;background:#f8f8f6;color:#1a1a1a;min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column}

        .topbar{background:#1a1a1a;padding:9px 0;font-size:11.5px;color:#888;letter-spacing:.3px}
        .topbar-inner{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px;display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;align-items:center}
        .topbar a{color:#888;transition:color .2s}
        .topbar a:hover{color:#fff}
        .t-sep{margin:0 12px;color:#3a3a3a}

        .header{background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e0db}
        .header-inner{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px 32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
        .logo{display:flex;flex-direction:column;cursor:pointer}
        .logo-text{font-size:26px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-1.5px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1}
        .logo-sub{font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:3px;color:#aaa;margin-top:3px;text-transform:uppercase}

        .gnb{background:#fff;border-bottom:1.5px solid #1a1a1a}
        .gnb-inner{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px;display:flex}
        .gnb a{display:flex;align-items:center;height:44px;padding:0 22px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#444;letter-spacing:.8px;border-bottom:2.5px solid transparent;transition:all .2s}
        .gnb a:hover{color:#1a1a1a;border-bottom-color:#1a1a1a}

        /* 중앙 컨텐츠 */
        .center-wrap{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:60px 20px}

        .admin-card{width:100%;max-width:420px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e0db;padding:52px 44px}

        .admin-logo{text-align:center;margin-bottom:36px}
        .admin-logo-text{font-size:30px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-1.5px;color:#1a1a1a;display:block;line-height:1;margin-bottom:6px}
        .admin-logo-sub{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:3px;color:#9b7f5a;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase}

        .admin-title{text-align:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3px;color:#aaa;margin-bottom:32px;padding-bottom:24px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0ede8}

        .form-group{margin-bottom:16px}
        .form-group input{width:100%;height:46px;padding:0 18px;border:1.5px solid #ddd;font-size:14px;outline:none;text-align:center;letter-spacing:3px;font-family:inherit;transition:border .2s;background:#fff}
        .form-group input:focus{border-color:#1a1a1a}
        .form-group input::placeholder{letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:13px;color:#bbb}

        .btn-enter{width:100%;padding:15px 0;background:#1a1a1a;color:#fff;border:none;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;cursor:pointer;margin-top:8px;transition:background .2s}
        .btn-enter:hover{background:#9b7f5a}

        .back-link{display:block;text-align:center;margin-top:24px;font-size:12px;color:#aaa;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.5px;transition:color .2s;text-decoration:none}
        .back-link:hover{color:#1a1a1a}

        .admin-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;background:#f8f8f6;border:1px solid #e2e0db;padding:5px 14px;border-radius:20px;font-size:11px;color:#888;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:28px}
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="topbar">
    <div class="topbar-inner">
        <a href="/">쇼핑몰 홈</a><span class="t-sep">|</span>
        <a href="/cs">고객센터</a>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="header">
    <div class="header-inner">
        <div class="logo" onclick="location.href='/'">
            <span class="logo-text">모아서</span>
            <span class="logo-sub">premium market</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<nav class="gnb">
    <div class="gnb-inner">
        <a href="/category/수산물">수산물</a>
        <a href="/category/농산물">농산물</a>
        <a href="/category/의류">의류</a>
    </div>
</nav>

<div class="center-wrap">
    <div class="admin-card">
        <div class="admin-logo">
            <a href="/" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit">
                <span class="admin-logo-text">모아서</span>
                <span class="admin-logo-sub">Admin System</span>
            </a>
        </div>

        <div style="text-align:center">
            <span class="admin-badge">🔐 관리자 전용</span>
        </div>

        <div class="admin-title">ADMINISTRATOR LOGIN</div>

        <form action="/admin/login" method="POST">
            <div class="form-group">
                <input type="password" name="keycode" placeholder="관리자 키코드를 입력하세요" required autofocus>
            </div>
            <button type="submit" class="btn-enter">입장하기 →</button>
        </form>

        <a href="/" class="back-link">← 쇼핑몰 홈으로 돌아가기</a>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>